o October came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in January to February and 37% in August to September. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 158% on the middle. Grid 23555 had its driest year in 1953 at 57%.</p>"}
